The package code is under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3.
The full text is in /usr/share/common-licenses/LGPL-3 on a Debian system.

The suffix-array code derives from libsais.
libsais is under the Apache License, version 2.0.
Copyright (C) 2021-2022 Ilya Grebnov.
A stability patch is Copyright (C) 2022 Kamila Szewczyk, under the same license.
The full text is in /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0 on a Debian system.
